usage: local_models.py jev-batch [-h] [--model MODEL] [--output OUTPUT]
                                 [--summary]
                                 input checks

positional arguments:
  input            UTF-8 source shared by the checks
  checks           JSON array of checks

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --model MODEL    TypeSafe model name or alias
  --output OUTPUT  also write the result JSON to this file
  --summary        print counts instead of all checks (requires --output)
